--- !u!114 &1389522805
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1389522804}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c86ae63c5b6f9b54291450cfca667b1b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::WhaleInteraction
  speakerName: Mr. Jones
  postCrabQuestDialogueLines:
  - speaker: Seahorse
    translatedSpeaker: "\u6D77\u9A6C"
    text: Mr. Jones!
    translatedText: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F\uFF01"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b1f66267cfee0ff48b607e750ccf57b0, type: 3}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: ...
    translatedText: ...
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Seahorse
    translatedSpeaker: "\u6D77\u9A6C"
    text: Mr. Jones?
    translatedText: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F\uFF1F"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: ...
    translatedText: 
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    translatedSpeaker: "\u6D77\u9A6C"
    text: "..\u2026\u2026(gasp)"
    translatedText: "\u2026\u2026\uFF08\u5438\u6C14\uFF09"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Seahorse
    translatedSpeaker: "\u6D77\u9A6C"
    text: MR.JONES!!!!
    translatedText: "\u743C\uFF01\u65AF\uFF01\u5148\uFF01\u751F\uFF01\uFF01\uFF01"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Narrator
    translatedSpeaker: "\u65C1\u767D"
    text: (The heavy movement of the moving belt stirred up sand, and Mr. Jones opened
      his eyes.)
    translatedText: "\uFF08\u6C89\u91CD\u7684\u79FB\u52A8\u58F0\u5E26\u8D77\u6D6E\u6C99\uFF0C\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F\u7741\u5F00\u4E86\u773C\u775B\uFF09"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4ba7d5e7329e3784fa426e48c2750c37, type: 3}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    translatedSpeaker: "\u6D77\u9A6C"
    text: My house is falling apart! When I bought it, the developer promised me
      it was built with the finest coral and would remain solid as a rock for thousands
      of years. So why is it crumbling to pieces after just two years?
    translatedText: "\u6211\u7684\u623F\u5B50\u574D\u584C\u4E86\uFF01\u5F53\u521D\u6211\u8D2D\u4E70\u5B83\u65F6\uFF0C\u5F00\u53D1\u5546\u5411\u6211\u4FDD\u8BC1\u8FD9\u623F\u5B50\u7528\u5F97\u662F\u6700\u597D\u7684\u73CA\u745A\uFF0C\u5C31\u7B97\u8FC7\u4E2A\u51E0\u5343\u5E74\u4E5F\u7167\u6837\u7ED3\u7ED3\u5B9E\u5B9E\u3002\u600E\u4E48\u8FD9\u624D\u6CA1\u8FC7\u4E24\u5E74\u5C31\u5657\u5657\u5F80\u4E0B\u843D\u7070\uFF1F"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: Yes...I can feel this......
    translatedText: "\u662F\u7684\u2026\u6211\u80FD\u611F\u89C9\u5230\u2026\u2026"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: The ocean... Is getting warmer...and warmer......
    translatedText: "\u6D77\u6D0B\u2026\u2026\u53D8\u5F97\u8D8A\u6765\u8D8A\u70ED\u4E86\u2026\u2026"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "When the water changes\u2026 the algae leave the coral."
    translatedText: "\u5F53\u6C34\u6E29\u53D1\u751F\u53D8\u5316\u65F6\u2026\u2026\u85FB\u7C7B\u5C31\u4F1A\u79BB\u5F00\u73CA\u745A\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "Without them\u2026 the coral cannot survive."
    translatedText: "\u6CA1\u6709\u5B83\u4EEC...\u73CA\u745A\u5C31\u4F1A\u67AF\u6B7B\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    translatedSpeaker: "\u6D77\u9A6C"
    text: But why is this happening now?!
    translatedText: "\u53EF\u662F\u4E3A\u4EC0\u4E48\u4F1A\u53D8\u6210\u8FD9\u6837\uFF1F"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    translatedSpeaker: "\u6D77\u9A6C"
    text: "It wasn\u2019t like this before!"
    translatedText: "\u4EE5\u524D\u53EF\u4E0D\u662F\u8FD9\u6837\u7684\uFF01"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: Because...humans have started interfering again....
    translatedText: "\u56E0\u4E3A...\u4EBA\u7C7B...\u53C8\u5F00\u59CB\u5E72\u6D89\u4E86..."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    translatedSpeaker: "\u6D77\u9A6C"
    text: Humans?
    translatedText: "\u4EBA\u7C7B...\uFF1F"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    translatedSpeaker: "\u6D77\u9A6C"
    text: What are they doing in our place?
    translatedText: "\u4ED6\u4EEC\u5728\u6211\u4EEC\u7684\u5730\u76D8\u505A\u4EC0\u4E48\uFF1F"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: You will...find out......
    translatedText: "\u4F60\u4F1A...\u660E\u767D\u7684..."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    translatedSpeaker: "\u6D77\u9A6C"
    text: Anyways. So, how can I stop them? I need to save my house from falling
      apart! It cost me greatly!
    translatedText: "\u4E0D\u7BA1\u600E\u4E48\u8BF4\uFF0C\u6211\u8981\u600E\u4E48\u963B\u6B62\u4ED6\u4EEC\uFF1F\u6211\u5FC5\u987B\u5F97\u633D\u6551\u6211\u7684\u623F\u5B50\uFF0C\u90A3\u53EF\u662F\u82B1\u4E86\u6211\u6574\u6574\u4E00\u5E74\u7684\u5DE5\u8D44..."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "There was once\u2026an agreement\u2026"
    translatedText: "\u5F88\u4E45\u5F88\u4E45\u4EE5\u524D..."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 69c1c5afb8222f3438a94c00ed97a47e, type: 3}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "Between the ocean\u2026 and humanity."
    translatedText: "\u4EBA\u7C7B\u548C\u6D77\u6D0B\u6709\u4E2A\u5951\u7EA6\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "If the ocean was ever in danger\u2026we had a way to call them\u2026"
    translatedText: "\u5982\u679C\u6D77\u6D0B\u9700\u8981\u5E2E\u52A9...\u6211\u4EEC\u53EF\u4EE5\u5411\u4EBA\u7C7B\u547C\u6551\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: We play a symphony, and humans will help us...
    translatedText: "\u6211\u4EEC\u5411\u4ED6\u4EEC\u6F14\u594F\u4E00\u9996\u7279\u522B\u7684\u4EA4\u54CD\u66F2...\u4ED6\u4EEC\u5C31\u4F1A\u6765\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "The melody was divided\u2026kept by different species."
    translatedText: "\u65CB\u5F8B\u548C\u4E50\u5668\u88AB\u5206\u5F00...\u7531\u4E0D\u540C\u7684\u79CD\u65CF\u638C\u7BA1\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "Only when all parts are played together\u2026can humans understand us."
    translatedText: "\u53EA\u6709\u5F53\u4E00\u8D77\u6F14\u594F\u5B8C\u6574\u7684\u65CB\u5F8B\u65F6...\u4EBA\u7C7B\u65B9\u80FD\u542C\u61C2\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    translatedSpeaker: "\u6D77\u9A6C"
    text: "Then\u2026 we just need to gather them, right?"
    translatedText: "\u90A3\u6211\u53EA\u9700\u8981\u6536\u96C6\u6240\u6709\u7684\u65CB\u5F8B\u5C31\u884C\u4E86\uFF0C\u5BF9\u5427\uFF1F"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "It won\u2019t be that simple...The ocean is no longer united..."
    translatedText: "\u6CA1\u4F60\u60F3\u5F97\u90A3\u4E48\u7B80\u5355...\u6D77\u6D0B...\u5DF2\u7ECF\u4E0D\u518D\u56E2\u7ED3\u4E86..."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "Many species no longer trust each other\u2026"
    translatedText: "\u79CD\u65CF\u76F4\u63A5\u4E92\u76F8\u731C\u5FCC...\u6050\u60E7\u548C\u7EDD\u671B\u586B\u6EE1\u4E86\u8FD9\u7247\u6D77\u57DF...\u5927\u5BB6\u4E0D\u518D\u76F8\u4FE1\u5BF9\u65B9\u4E86..."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: or humans...
    translatedText: "\u4EBA\u7C7B\u4E5F\u88AB\u89C6\u4E3A\u80CC\u4FE1\u5F03\u4E49\u7684\u5BB6\u4F19..."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "If you want their help\u2026"
    translatedText: "\u5982\u679C\u4F60\u60F3\u8981\u4ECE\u522B\u7684\u79CD\u65CF\u8EAB\u4E0A\u5F97\u5230\u4ED6\u4EEC\u638C\u63A7\u7684\u65CB\u5F8B..."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: you must go find them.
    translatedText: "\u5C31\u53BB\u627E\u4ED6\u4EEC\u5427\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "The crabs has a part\u2026You can start with them\u2026"
    translatedText: "\u8783\u87F9\u65CF\u6709\u4E00\u6BB5\u65CB\u5F8B...\u4F60\u53EF\u4EE5\u4ECE\u5B83\u4EEC\u5F00\u59CB..."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: They live not far from here...
    translatedText: "\u4ED6\u4EEC\u4F4F\u7684\u4E0D\u8FDC..."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "If the waters are polluted\u2026they must already be struggling..."
    translatedText: "\u5982\u679C\u8FD9\u7247\u6D77\u57DF\u4E5F\u88AB\u6C61\u67D3\u4E86...\u4ED6\u4EEC\u80AF\u5B9A\u5DF2\u7ECF\u4E3E\u6B65\u7EF4\u8270\u4E86\u2026\u2026"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: Head right...and follow the current past the cliff to the waters where
      they live...
    translatedText: "\u5411\u53F3\u8D70...\u4F7F\u7528\u6D0B\u6D41\u524D\u5F80\u4ED6\u4EEC\u5C45\u4F4F\u7684\u5730\u65B9..."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    translatedSpeaker: "\u6D77\u9A6C"
    text: "I\u2019ll convince them."
    translatedText: "\u6211\u4F1A\u8BF4\u670D\u4ED6\u4EEC\u7684\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "\u2026Be careful."
    translatedText: "...\u5C0F\u5FC3\u70B9\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 69c1c5afb8222f3438a94c00ed97a47e, type: 3}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "Not everyone will welcome you\u2026"
    translatedText: "\u6DF1\u6D77\u5904\u5904\u662F\u5371\u9669...\u4E0D\u662F\u6240\u6709\u4EBA\u90FD\u6B22\u8FCE\u4F60..."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Narrator
    translatedSpeaker: "\u65C1\u767D"
    text: (And Mr.Jones closed his eyes, fall asleep again.)
    translatedText: "\uFF08\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F\u95ED\u4E0A\u4E86\u773C\u3002\uFF09"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  repeatDialogueLines:
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: ......
    translatedText: 
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  randomRepeatDialogueBlocks: []
  postDolphinQuestDialogueLines:
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    translatedSpeaker: "\u6D77\u9A6C"
    text: Mr. Jones, I'm back.
    translatedText: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F\uFF0C\u6211\u56DE\u6765\u4E86\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Narrator
    translatedSpeaker: "\u65C1\u767D"
    text: (Mr. Jones opened his eyes.)
    translatedText: "\uFF08\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F\u7741\u5F00\u4E86\u773C\u775B\u3002\uFF09"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: You made it...
    translatedText: "\u4F60\u505A\u5230\u4E86\u2026"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: Good job...
    translatedText: "\u5E72\u5F97\u4E0D\u9519\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Narrator
    translatedSpeaker: "\u65C1\u767D"
    text: (Mr. Jones looked at Bob.)
    translatedText: "\uFF08\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F\u770B\u4E86\u770B\u9C8D\u52C3\u3002\uFF09"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "\u2026Good...One piece\u2026found."
    translatedText: "\u5F88\u597D...\u627E\u5230\u4E00\u90E8\u5206\u4E86..."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "They don\u2019t trust easily...You did well."
    translatedText: "\u4ED6\u4EEC\u4E0D\u5BB9\u6613\u4FE1\u4EFB\u4ED6\u4EBA\u2026\u2026\u505A\u5F97\u597D\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    translatedSpeaker: "\u6D77\u9A6C"
    text: Where do I go next?
    translatedText: "\u6211\u63A5\u4E0B\u6765\u5E94\u8BE5\u53BB\u54EA\u91CC\uFF1F"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "\u2026The dolphins."
    translatedText: "\u53BB\u627E\u6D77\u8C5A\u2026\u2026"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 69c1c5afb8222f3438a94c00ed97a47e, type: 3}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    translatedSpeaker: "\u6D77\u9A6C"
    text: Ok. I'll go.
    translatedText: "\u597D\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  postOctopusQuestDialogueLines:
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    translatedSpeaker: "\u6D77\u9A6C"
    text: "Mr. Jones\u2026 I\u2019m back."
    translatedText: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F\u2026\u2026\u6211\u56DE\u6765\u4E86\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "\u2026Mm. I can hear it..."
    translatedText: "\u6211\u80FD\u542C\u89C1\u2026"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "\u2026A strong voice."
    translatedText: "\u2026\u2026\u6709\u529B\u91CF\u7684\u6B4C\u58F0\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: Now find the others. Before the ocean goes silent.
    translatedText: "\u73B0\u5728\u2026\u53BB\u627E\u5176\u4ED6\u4EBA\u3002\u5728\u6D77\u6D0B\u5F7B\u5E95\u6C89\u5BC2\u4E4B\u524D\u2026\u2026"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    translatedSpeaker: "\u6D77\u9A6C"
    text: Who's next?
    translatedText: "\u4E0B\u4E2A\u662F\u8C01\uFF1F"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "\u2026The octopus."
    translatedText: "\u2026\u7AE0\u9C7C\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: Hurry up, time is running out.
    translatedText: "\u5FEB\u70B9\u2026\u65F6\u95F4\u4E0D\u591A\u4E86\u2026\u2026"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 69c1c5afb8222f3438a94c00ed97a47e, type: 3}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "Their home\u2026 is being torn apart by machines..."
    translatedText: "\u4ED6\u4EEC\u7684\u5BB6\u2026\u5C31\u8981\u88AB\u94A2\u7B4B\u94F8\u6210\u7684\u91CE\u517D\u6495\u788E\u4E86\u2026\u2026"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    translatedSpeaker: "\u6D77\u9A6C"
    text: "I understand. I\u2019ll help them."
    translatedText: "\u6211\u660E\u767D\u4E86\u3002\u6211\u4F1A\u5E2E\u52A9\u4ED6\u4EEC\u7684\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  postSeaCucumberQuestDialogueLines:
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    translatedSpeaker: "\u6D77\u9A6C"
    text: "Mr. Jones\u2026 I\u2019m back."
    translatedText: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F\u2026\u6211\u56DE\u6765\u4E86\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "The rhythm\u2026 is stronger now."
    translatedText: "\u65CB\u5F8B\u2026\u2026\u3001\u8D8A\u6765\u8D8A\u54CD\u4EAE\u4E86\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: You found Shrauk...Good...
    translatedText: "\u4F60\u627E\u5230\u4E86\u6C99\u514B\u2026\u2026\u5F88\u597D\u2026\u2026\u7701\u4E86\u4E0D\u5C11\u4E8B\u2026\u2026"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: Then you'll only need one last piece...
    translatedText: "\u90A3\u4E48\u2026\u4F60\u53EA\u9700\u8981\u2026\u6700\u540E\u4E00\u4E2A\u4E86\u2026\u2026"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    translatedSpeaker: "\u6D77\u9A6C"
    text: Who has it?
    translatedText: "\u6211\u8BE5\u53BB\u627E\u8C01\uFF1F"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: Dr. Luma...
    translatedText: "\u9646\u739B\u533B\u751F\u2026\u2026"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: The sea cucumber.
    translatedText: "\u90A3\u4E2A\u6D77\u53C2\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "He heals\u2026what others cannot."
    translatedText: "\u4ED6\u80FD\u6CBB\u6108\u2026\u65C1\u4EBA\u6240\u4E0D\u80FD\u7684\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: Let Shrauk take you there...
    translatedText: "\u8BA9\u6C99\u514B\u5E26\u4F60\u8FC7\u53BB\u2026\u2026"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  afterSeaCucumberCompletedDialogueLines:
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    translatedSpeaker: "\u6D77\u9A6C"
    text: "Mr. Jones\u2026Everyone\u2019s here."
    translatedText: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F\uFF0C\u5927\u5BB6\u90FD\u5230\u9F50\u4E86\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Narrator
    translatedSpeaker: "\u65C1\u767D"
    text: (Mr. Jones slowly opens his eyes.)
    translatedText: "\uFF08\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F\u7F13\u7F13\u7741\u5F00\u4E86\u773C\u775B\u3002\uFF09"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "\u2026Yes. I can hear it clearly now."
    translatedText: "\u2026\u2026\u6CA1\u9519\uFF0C\u6211\u80FD\u542C\u6E05\u4E86\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: You did it.
    translatedText: "\u4F60\u505A\u5230\u4E86\u2026\u2026"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: You brought them together.
    translatedText: "\u4F60\u628A\u5927\u5BB6\u805A\u5230\u4E00\u8D77\u4E86\u2026\u2026"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    translatedSpeaker: "\u6D77\u9A6C"
    text: "So\u2026 we can start?"
    translatedText: "\u6240\u4EE5\u2026\u6211\u4EEC\u53EF\u4EE5\u5F00\u59CB\u4E86\u5417\uFF1F"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "\u2026Yes. "
    translatedText: "\u2026\u662F\u7684\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: "The symphony\u2026 is ready."
    translatedText: "\u4EA4\u54CD\u66F2\u2026\u5DF2\u7ECF\u51C6\u5907\u597D\u4E86\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: Let them hear us.
    translatedText: "\u8BA9\u4EBA\u7C7B\u542C\u89C1\u6211\u4EEC\u3002"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 69c1c5afb8222f3438a94c00ed97a47e, type: 3}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  ensemblePromptDialogueLines:
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    translatedSpeaker: "\u743C\u65AF\u5148\u751F"
    text: Are you ready?
    translatedText: "\u4F60\u51C6\u5907\u597D\u4E86\u5417\uFF1F"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 69c1c5afb8222f3438a94c00ed97a47e, type: 3}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  ensembleYesLabel: Yes
  ensembleNoLabel: No
  endingSceneName: ChorusScene
  objectToActivate: {fileID: 85474048}
